WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.334
Hello Karin

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.043
Haley

00:00:02.043 --> 00:00:02.961
Byron

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:03.753
Daniel

00:00:03.753 --> 00:00:04.504
Laura

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.548
This is the Nicholl Fellowship Comittee

00:00:06.756 --> 00:00:10.218
You are a 2021 Nicholl Fellow

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:11.636
Hang on, can you say that again? 

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.971
(laughter)

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:15.056
Wow, guys, thank you.

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:16.725
Okay, great. So, it's good.

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:18.435
It means you won.

00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:19.477
Thank you so much. 

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:20.103
Oh my god.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:22.480
I am enormously happy.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.107
What an accomplishment.

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.151
I really enjoyed
reading your scripts

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:26.985
You read it?

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:28.236
I loved your script.

00:00:28.361 --> 00:00:30.155
I'm super psyched about that. 

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:32.073
Let's just say you're the director.

00:00:32.073 --> 00:00:33.616
It really comes down
to three things

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:36.369
hard work, luck and talent.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.121
Thank you so much, truly. 

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:40.123
Did that just happen?

00:00:40.123 --> 00:00:43.043
That was so enjoyable
 to explore the writing process.

00:00:43.251 --> 00:00:47.589
It has felt all the way along
 like a welcoming environment.

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:49.007
We all start somewhere. 

00:00:49.007 --> 00:00:51.426
It's helped me have
full confidence in myself.

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.469
I get to write every day.

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:54.804
There's nothing that can stop me
 from doing that.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:58.308
To get this sort of recognition
 just made it all so worth it.

